{"title":"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 30","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/1/bf1929d3d66cb74d3d7de3d191c627f840e2e93b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 1{1\\cdot 2\\cdot 3\\cdot 4} + \\frac 1{2\\cdot 3\\cdot 4\\cdot 5} + \\frac 1{3\\cdot 4\\cdot 5\\cdot 6} + \\cdots + \\frac 1{28\\cdot 29\\cdot 30\\cdot 31} =$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"484\" height=\"37\" /></center>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/f/2cf3f0266f99e6debc69b0abdc9bdbe1e0b394f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ }1/18 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }1/21 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ }4/93 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ }128/2505 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ }  749/13485$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"559\" height=\"18\" /></center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_30&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factoring out a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/1/4e1965f8d70832ded66434c75a7bd52b75090af0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> telescopes the sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/8/478a2b0a3c4da09d9539c659c389f5f5ac95251b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{3}\\left(\\frac{1}{1 \\cdot 2 \\cdot 3}-\\frac{1}{29 \\cdot 30 \\cdot 31}\\right) = \\frac{749}{13485}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"278\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam/Problem_29\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam/Problem 29\">Previous Problem</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=University_of_South_Carolina_High_School_Math_Contest/1993_Exam\" title=\"University of South Carolina High School Math Contest/1993 Exam\">Back to Exam</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017130837\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 21/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1085/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:3432:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017130837 and revision id 16228. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}